Subject: [PATCH] apk: preflight full upgrades and expose transaction plans

Validate a full managed transaction before self-upgrade writes. Retain
ABI-bound packages with temporary constraints for userspace-only updates.
Authenticate payloads before commit and report input-bound plans.

---
