 *--prune*
 	Prune the _world_ by removing packages which are no longer available
 	from any configured repository.
+
+*--userspace-only*
+	Upgrade userspace while retaining installed kernel-bound packages by identity.
+	The extra constraints are temporary and do not change world. This option
+	requires a full upgrade and cannot be combined with --available, --prune
+	or --preupgrade-only. The default upgrade never falls back to this mode.
